  "testing_requirements": "All interactive and key informational elements MUST include a 'data-testid' attribute (e.g., data-testid='add-to-cart-button', data-testid='menu-item-croissant').",
  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Install and use lucide-react for icons.",
    "Install Google Fonts 'Cormorant Garamond' and 'Manrope'.",
    "Implement a fully functional Add to Cart and Cart Drawer (e-commerce lite).",
    "Use Shadcn UI for standard complex components (Drawer, Dialog), but override styles to match the 'rounded-none', sharp, elegant aesthetic.",
    "DO NOT USE ANY FOOD IMAGERY. STRICTLY use the provided media URLs.",
    "Sections needed: Hero, Menu, Gallery, Location/Hours, About, Footer.",
    "Use 'orange' (#F25C05) as the primary brand color, with navy blue (#002654) and red (#ED2939) as subtle accents (e.g., thin border lines or small decorative elements) to hint at the French flag."
  ]
